### Week12 API 測試
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### === 步驟 1: 登入 ===

### 登入管理員
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 登入學生
# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### === 步驟 2: 設定變數 ===

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.token}}

### === 步驟 3: 創建測試資料 ===

### 學生創建資料
# @name createStudentData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "name": "測試學生",
  "email": "student-test-data@example.com",
  "phone": "0912345678"
}

### 管理員創建資料
# @name createAdminData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "測試管理員",
  "email": "admin-test-data@example.com",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

### === 步驟 4: 設定資料 ID 變數 ===

@studentDataId = {{createStudentData.response.body.id}}
@adminDataId = {{createAdminData.response.body.id}}

### === 步驟 5: 權限測試 ===

### 學生嘗試刪除管理員資料（應 403）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/signup/{{adminDataId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 學生刪除自己資料（應 200）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/signup/{{studentDataId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 管理員刪除自己資料（應 200）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/signup/{{adminDataId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}